{"title": "Deflect Missiles", "pageid": 8404, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Deflect_Missiles", "categories": ["Class actions", "Reactions", "Bugs", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the monk reaction to reduce the damage of a missile attack. For the follow up reaction to throw back the projectile, see <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\">Deflect Missiles: Redirect</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp, /w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp/300px-Deflect_Missiles.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Deflect_Missiles.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Deflect Missiles</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">reaction</a> gained by <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">monk</a> at level 3. Deflect Missiles allows the monk to reduce incoming damage from ranged weapon attacks and optionally return the projectile.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Reduce the damage from a ranged weapon attack by 1d10 + your Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modifier\">modifier</a> + your monk level.\n</p><p>If the damage is reduced to 0, you can use a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/30px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/40px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Point</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/30px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect the Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\">Deflect the Missile</a>. \n</p>\nYou can only reduce damage from the attack - any additional effects can't be negated.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_DeflectMissiles</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_DeflectMissiles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_DeflectMissiles\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/60px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/80px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\">Deflect Missiles: Redirect</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reducing damage does not negate any other effects of the attack. Conditions such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaping Wounds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\">Piercing Strike</a> are still applied, even if the damage is reduced to 0.</li>\n<li>This reaction works against any attack that uses a ranged weapon attack roll.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Damage does <i>not</i> need to be reduced to 0 in order to redirect the attack.</li>\n<li>Against ranged attacks that fire multiple projectiles, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Multiattack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Multiattack (Ranged)\">Multiattack (Ranged)</a> or dual wielded <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\">Hand Crossbows</a>, only the last attack can be deflected to reduce its damage. None of the projectiles can be thrown back with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/30px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/40px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp/20px-Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Deflect_Missiles_Redirect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deflect_Missiles:_Redirect\" title=\"Deflect Missiles: Redirect\">Deflect Missiles: Redirect</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035041\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2923/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30615/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14729/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1593493/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.275      1 -total\n 99.06%   64.661      1 Template:Feature_page\n 71.48%   46.659     30 Template:Trim\n 18.55%   12.110      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.77%   11.598      6 Template:Icon_link\n 17.62%   11.499      4 Template:SmSAI\n 16.66%   10.873      6 Template:Icon_text\n 13.11%    8.557      1 Template:Resource\n 10.66%    6.960      1 Template:SmCond\n 10.19%    6.653      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8404-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035041 and revision id 348834. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}